From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Sargison <sargo@sargo.cc>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:59:13 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 46/54] Plutonium: the computer serving the app can't be
 unchecked in setup

The welcome wizard's "Connect your computers" step listed the computer
serving the app (the desktop's own server, on loopback) with a checkbox
like any other. Setup without it makes no sense: it stays selected, and
its box is disabled.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Lr3o5goyP12YH1o4ZFLwrH
